  "description": "Cross-app link authorization for CircleAI — the standalone service app other\n      apps bind to for a shared on-device brain. Pure abstractions + policy:\n      LinkScope, LinkGrant, ILinkGrantStore, LinkGate (Allow / AutoApprove /\n      NeedAuth / Deny) and LinkAuthorizer (mint-on-approval). NO Android, auth, or\n      AetherNet dependency — the device layer supplies the caller identity and the\n      IAuthChallenge-backed approval callback, so this stays desktop-testable.",
